# The solver's budget is 100000 conflicts or 100 million steps (watched
# clauses visited), a count and not a time (#488), so where it gives up is
# the same on every machine: a product against its swap under an xor (no
# polynomial to expand) gives up by steps
a(x: u32, y: u32) = (x*y) ^ 5
b(x: u32, y: u32) = (y*x) ^ 5
equiv a b
